WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.929
Maybe we can go
to the Snow Ball together.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:13.430
Snow Ball?

00:00:13.514 --> 00:00:14.973
It's this cheesy
school dance

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:16.934
where you go to the gym and
dance to music.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.060
I've never been,

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:20.771
but I know you shouldn't go
with your sister.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.272
-No?
-I mean…

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.983
You can,
but it'd be really weird.

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:26.944
You go to school dances
with…

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.654
some that, you know…

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.906
Someone that you like.

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:33.367
-A friend?
-Not a friend.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:35.744
A…

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.413
A… Someone like a…

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:50.551
Hey.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.761
Sky?

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:56.515
I'm a fixer because…

00:00:57.516 --> 00:00:58.600
I have to be.

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:00.602
Because I'm supposed to be.

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.106
Because…

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.235
When I fix other people,

00:01:08.318 --> 00:01:11.113
I don't have to think about
how fucking broken I am.

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:13.031
Sky…

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.993
We're all broken, Bloom.

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:21.248
There's a charm in that,
too.

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:39.808
It's sucks
you're avoiding me.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.396
I put myself out there

00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:47.733
and I was honest with you

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.944
and for that
I get the silent treatment?

00:01:53.864 --> 00:01:55.824
Even if
you don't feel the same,

00:01:55.908 --> 00:01:57.910
you can at least
be there for me as a friend.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.746
You're making me feel crazy!

00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:05.626
Honestly,

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:07.836
if I knew

00:02:08.629 --> 00:02:10.214
that you were going to be
all weird

00:02:10.297 --> 00:02:12.591
and that this was going to
jeopardise our friendship,

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:14.301
I never in a million years

00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:15.802
would have told you
how I felt.

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:17.095
Because

00:02:17.179 --> 00:02:19.515
it is becoming
incredibly clear that

00:02:19.598 --> 00:02:20.974
you don't feel the same way.

00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:37.574
Come back to the party.

00:02:38.242 --> 00:02:39.535
Stop walking!

00:02:39.618 --> 00:02:42.204
-Stop following me.
-It is not safe out here.

00:02:42.913 --> 00:02:44.289
I forbid you
to go any further.

00:02:44.373 --> 00:02:45.999
You cannot tell me
what to do.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.417
Daphne.

00:02:49.253 --> 00:02:50.254
You won't listen!

00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:04.059
My most sincere apologies.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.356
I…

00:03:18.407 --> 00:03:21.285
And I know weird stuff
might be a trigger for you.

00:03:23.078 --> 00:03:24.496
Thanks for telling me, Roz.

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:28.125
And, yeah. Weird stuff is
a trigger for me.

00:03:29.459 --> 00:03:30.711
But…

00:03:30.794 --> 00:03:31.795
honesty's…

00:03:32.588 --> 00:03:34.756
kind of the thing
I value most these days.

00:03:35.424 --> 00:03:36.466
So we're good?

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:42.055
We will be.

00:03:43.432 --> 00:03:44.433
As soon as…

00:03:45.017 --> 00:03:45.893
What?

00:04:05.495 --> 00:04:06.413
Was that…

00:04:07.122 --> 00:04:08.165
like your vision?

00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:13.504
Usually my visions lead to
something bad happening.

00:04:15.589 --> 00:04:16.507
This time…

00:04:17.883 --> 00:04:20.385
Nothing bad happened,
Rosalind.

00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:25.891
Hi.

00:04:26.433 --> 00:04:27.309
Was I drooling?

00:04:29.561 --> 00:04:30.437
Sorry.

00:04:31.188 --> 00:04:33.398
How did it go? Did you
make it down there in time?

00:04:34.441 --> 00:04:35.442
Yeah.

00:04:37.861 --> 00:04:38.737
You stayed.

00:04:39.947 --> 00:04:40.822
Yeah.

00:04:41.532 --> 00:04:42.866
I just wanted to make sure…

00:04:43.575 --> 00:04:44.826
you were ok.

00:05:07.099 --> 00:05:08.308
Because the doctor

00:05:09.059 --> 00:05:11.103
wanted to see
how my lung was healing

00:05:12.437 --> 00:05:14.398
and he found a tumour
the size of a walnut

00:05:14.481 --> 00:05:15.858
inside my left breast.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:18.026
What?

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:19.528
And I don't have long.

00:05:20.112 --> 00:05:21.613
-We will find someone.
-We…

00:05:22.948 --> 00:05:24.658
-We'll find a doctor.
-No.

00:05:24.741 --> 00:05:26.785
-You have to stop.
-Listen to me!

00:05:26.869 --> 00:05:28.161
You have to stop!

00:05:28.245 --> 00:05:30.455
There is nothing
that anyone can do.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:32.165
Ok.

00:05:34.626 --> 00:05:35.502
Ok.

00:05:37.671 --> 00:05:39.173
I'm going to find someone.

00:05:40.799 --> 00:05:41.758
A doctor.

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:45.053
We have all the money
in the world.

00:05:46.972 --> 00:05:49.224
We will go to the ends
of the Earth if we have to.

00:05:49.808 --> 00:05:52.436
I love you. Do you hear me?
I will not lose you.

00:05:55.772 --> 00:05:57.107
Mildred…

00:05:57.191 --> 00:05:59.067
-I love you.
-I love you.

00:06:17.085 --> 00:06:18.837
Sorry! Sorry.

00:06:22.132 --> 00:06:23.217
Sorry.

00:06:23.759 --> 00:06:25.093
Ok. Thank you.

00:06:25.719 --> 00:06:27.596
Oh my God.

00:06:27.679 --> 00:06:29.765
Sorry, I know that you were…

00:06:30.432 --> 00:06:33.101
probably expecting Olivia,
we don't have to do anything

00:06:33.185 --> 00:06:34.186
if you don't want to.

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:38.148
Truth be told, I've never
kissed anyone before.

00:06:38.232 --> 00:06:39.650
I've wanted to.

00:06:39.733 --> 00:06:40.692
Don't get me wrong.

00:06:40.776 --> 00:06:42.945
For example,
I punched Ron Getler

00:06:43.028 --> 00:06:45.197
in the sixth grade during
seven minutes in Heaven.

00:06:46.532 --> 00:06:48.200
Sophomore year spring fling,

00:06:48.283 --> 00:06:50.619
I was dancing
with Randy Melrose.

00:06:51.119 --> 00:06:52.663
You know,
a romantic song came on

00:06:52.746 --> 00:06:54.831
and I was like:
"What's going to happen?"

00:06:54.915 --> 00:06:56.875
Until it just didn't,
because--

00:07:01.755 --> 00:07:03.423
This isn't so bad!

00:07:04.383 --> 00:07:05.717
Not so bad at all.

00:07:06.468 --> 00:07:07.344
Wait!

00:07:27.823 --> 00:07:29.199
I'm not…

00:07:30.951 --> 00:07:33.161
I'm not… Hey, wait!

00:07:39.042 --> 00:07:41.295
I'm not… Sorry, I'm not…

00:08:44.483 --> 00:08:45.984
You could move in here
if you want.

00:08:47.319 --> 00:08:49.112
You know? For free.

00:08:53.951 --> 00:08:54.868
Really?

00:08:54.952 --> 00:08:55.869
Yeah.

00:08:57.371 --> 00:08:58.247
Really.

00:09:15.806 --> 00:09:16.932
Sorry, I…

00:09:17.015 --> 00:09:18.392
No, no.

00:09:20.811 --> 00:09:22.437
I just wasn't ready.

00:09:27.943 --> 00:09:28.819
I'm ready now.

00:09:36.243 --> 00:09:37.327
Now or never.

